!                                                                                                   
! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian                                       
!                                                                                                   
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
CH Molecule. X2C Hamiltonian. CC energies.                                                          
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.PROPERTIES                                                                                         
.4INDEX                                                                                             
**GENERAL                                                                                           
.CVALUE                                                                                             
137.03599907400d0                                                                                   
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.X2Cmmf                                                                                             
.DOSSSS                                                                                             
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.EXACC                                                                                              
*SCF                                                                                                
.CLOSED SHELL                                                                                       
6                                                                                                   
.OPEN SHELL                                                                                         
1                                                                                                   
1 / 2                                                                                               
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0D-9 1.0D-8                                                                                       
**MOLTRA                                                                                            
.ACTIVE                                                                                             
energy -1.0 2.0 0.01                                                                                
.NO4IND                                                                                             
**EXACC                                                                                             
.OCCUPIED                                                                                           
2..3                                                                                                
.VIRTUAL                                                                                            
4..22                                                                                               
.OCC_BETA                                                                                           
2..4                                                                                                
.VIR_BETA                                                                                           
5..22                                                                                               
.NCYCLES                                                                                            
100                                                                                                 
.TCONVERG                                                                                           
1.0D-8                                                                                              
.PRINT                                                                                              
4                                                                                                   
.NOTRIPLES                                                                                          
.LAMBDA                                                                                             
**INTEGRALS                                                                                         
.NUCMOD                                                                                             
 1                                                                                                  
*READIN                                                                                             
.UNCONTRACT                                                                                         
**PROPERTIES                                                                                        
.PRINT                                                                                              
4                                                                                                   
.DIPOLE                                                                                             
!.EFG                                                                                               
*END OF                                                                                             


